                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "cwqf1",
                      "name": "N",
                      "fill": "#2E3A24",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "OUTLINE is the default: the k channel becomes ink, the body becomes paper. Each sprite also declares a pattern channel — the marking that identifies the species — which is forced to ink so it survives. SOLID is reserved for silhouette states: undiscovered dex slots, blips beyond scan range, and nocturnal species.",
