                  "name": "Sub",
                  "fill": "#2E3A24",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Every creature is authored once at 18×18 and drawn only at whole multiples — 1×, 2×, 3×, 4×, 6×, 8×. Nothing is ever resampled, so no tier is ever soft. In 1-bit the tier also decides the render: at T0 and T1 the outline closes up into mush, so those two tiers switch to 100% fill; T2 and above keep the outline.",
