                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "RULE · never scale a sprite by a non-integer factor, and never scale one up past its authored tier. A creature needed larger than T5 gets a redrawn 32×32 master, not a stretched 18×18.",
